\u272?\u432?\u7907?c ph\u233?p ph\u226?n ph\u7889?i v\u224? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \u7903? d\u7841?ng m\u227? ngu\u7891?n v\u224? d\u7841?ng nh\u7883? ph\u226?n, c\u243? ho\u7863?c kh\u244?ng s\u7917?a \u273?\u7893?i, v\u7899?i \u273?i\u7873?u ki\u7879?n \u273?\u225?p \u7913?ng c\u225?c \u273?i\u7873?u ki\u7879?n sau:\
1. Vi\u7879?c ph\u226?n ph\u7889?i m\u227? ngu\u7891?n ph\u7843?i gi\u7919? l\u7841?i th\u244?ng b\u225?o b\u7843?n quy\u7873?n n\u234?u tr\u234?n, danh s\u225?ch c\u225?c \u273?i\u7873?u ki\u7879?n n\u224?y v\u224? tuy\u234?n b\u7889? t\u7915? ch\u7889?i tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m d\u432?\u7899?i \u273?\u226?y.\
2. Vi\u7879?c ph\u226?n ph\u7889?i d\u432?\u7899?i d\u7841?ng nh\u7883? ph\u226?n ph\u7843?i t\u225?i t\u7841?o th\u244?ng b\u225?o b\u7843?n quy\u7873?n n\u234?u tr\u234?n, danh s\u225?ch c\u225?c \u273?i\u7873?u ki\u7879?n n\u224?y v\u224? tuy\u234?n b\u7889? t\u7915? ch\u7889?i tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m d\u432?\u7899?i \u273?\u226?y trong t\u224?i li\u7879?u v\u224?/ho\u7863?c c\u225?c t\u224?i li\u7879?u kh\u225?c \u273?i k\u232?m b\u7843?n ph\u226?n ph\u7889?i.\
PH\u7846?N M\u7872?M N\u192?Y \u272?\u431?\u7906?C T\u193?C GI\u7842? CUNG C\u7844?P \u8220?NGUY\u202?N TR\u7840?NG\u8221?, KH\u212?NG C\u211? B\u7844?T K\u7922? B\u7842?O \u272?\u7842?M N\u192?O, R\u213? R\u192?NG HAY NG\u7908? \u221?, BAO G\u7890?M NH\u431?NG KH\u212?NG GI\u7898?I H\u7840?N \u7902? C\u193?C B\u7842?O \u272?\u7842?M NG\u7908? \u221? V\u7872? KH\u7842? N\u258?NG KINH DOANH V\u192? S\u7920? PH\u217? H\u7906?P V\u7898?I M\u7896?T M\u7908?C \u272?\u205?CH C\u7908? TH\u7874?, \u272?\u7872?U B\u7882? T\u7914? CH\u7888?I. TRONG M\u7884?I TR\u431?\u7900?NG H\u7906?P, T\u193?C GI\u7842? KH\u212?NG CH\u7882?U TR\u193?CH NHI\u7878?M \u272?\u7888?I V\u7898?I B\u7844?T K\u7922? THI\u7878?T H\u7840?I TR\u7920?C TI\u7870?P, GI\u193?N TI\u7870?P, NG\u7850?U NHI\u202?N, \u272?\u7862?C BI\u7878?T, MANG T\u205?NH TR\u7914?NG PH\u7840?T HAY THI\u7878?T H\u7840?I H\u7878? QU\u7842? N\u192?O (BAO G\u7890?M NH\u431?NG KH\u212?NG GI\u7898?I H\u7840?N \u7902? VI\u7878?C MUA H\u192?NG H\u211?A HO\u7862?C D\u7882?CH V\u7908? THAY TH\u7870?; M\u7844?T M\u193?T V\u7872? S\u7916? D\u7908?NG, D\u7918? LI\u7878?U HO\u7862?C L\u7906?I NHU\u7852?N; HO\u7862?C GI\u193?N \u272?O\u7840?N KINH DOANH), D\u217? DO B\u7844?T K\u7922? NGUY\u202?N NH\u194?N N\u192?O V\u192? D\u7920?A TR\u202?N B\u7844?T K\u7922? L\u221? THUY\u7870?T TR\u193?CH NHI\u7878?M N\u192?O, D\u217? TRONG H\u7906?P \u272?\u7890?NG, TR\u193?CH NHI\u7878?M NGHI\u202?M NG\u7862?T HAY H\u192?NH VI G\u194?Y THI\u7878?T H\u7840?I (K\u7874? C\u7842? S\u416? SU\u7844?T HO\u7862?C C\u193?CH KH\u193?C) PH\u193?T SINH THEO B\u7844?T K\u7922? C\u193?CH N\u192?O T\u7914? VI\u7878?C S\u7916? D\u7908?NG PH\u7846?N M\u7872?M N\u192?Y, K\u7874? C\u7842? KHI \u272?\u195? \u272?\u431?\u7906?C TH\u212?NG B\u193?O V\u7872? KH\u7842? N\u258?NG X\u7842?Y RA THI\u7878?T H\u7840?I NH\u431? V\u7852?Y.\
