B\u7845?t k\u7923? ai c\u361?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c ph\u233?p d\u249?ng ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m n\u224?y cho m\u7909?c \u273?\u237?ch n\u224?o, k\u7875? c\u7843? th\u432?\u417?ng m\u7841?i, \u273?\u432?\u7907?c s\u7917?a \u273?\u7893?i v\u224? ph\u226?n ph\u7889?i l\u7841?i t\u7921? do, theo c\u225?c h\u7841?n ch\u7871? sau:\
1. Kh\u244?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c xuy\u234?n t\u7841?c ngu\u7891?n g\u7889?c c\u7911?a ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m n\u224?y; kh\u244?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c nh\u7853?n m\u236?nh l\u224? t\u225?c gi\u7843? c\u7911?a ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m g\u7889?c. N\u7871?u b\u7841?n d\u249?ng ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m n\u224?y trong m\u7897?t s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m, n\u234?n ghi nh\u7853?n trong t\u224?i li\u7879?u c\u7911?a s\u7843?n ph\u7849?m, nh\u432?ng \u273?i\u7873?u n\u224?y kh\u244?ng b\u7855?t bu\u7897?c.\
2. Phi\u234?n b\u7843?n m\u227? ngu\u7891?n \u273?\u227? s\u7917?a \u273?\u7893?i ph\u7843?i \u273?\u432?\u7907?c \u273?\u225?nh d\u7845?u r\u245? r\u224?ng l\u224? \u273?\u227? s\u7917?a \u273?\u7893?i, v\u224? kh\u244?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c xuy\u234?n t\u7841?c th\u224?nh ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m g\u7889?c.\
3. Th\u244?ng b\u225?o n\u224?y kh\u244?ng \u273?\u432?\u7907?c x\u243?a ho\u7863?c thay \u273?\u7893?i kh\u7887?i b\u7845?t k\u7923? b\u7843?n ph\u226?n ph\u7889?i m\u227? ngu\u7891?n n\u224?o.\
